New helper in Nav:

```java
static MapLocation afterPush(MapLocation n) {
    Direction c = MapMem.current(n.x, n.y);
    if (c == Direction.CENTER) return n;
    int px = n.x + c.dx, py = n.y + c.dy;
    return G.onMap(px, py) && !MapMem.isWall(px, py) ? new MapLocation(px, py) : n;
}
```

